WEBVTT

00:00:13.549 --> 00:00:15.942
Uh...

00:00:18.336 --> 00:00:20.164
Welcome back, Hermione.

00:00:20.164 --> 00:00:23.036
It's good to be back.

00:00:23.036 --> 00:00:25.430
Congratulations.
I can't believe you solved it.

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:27.780
Well, we had loads
of help from you.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.695
We couldn't have done it
without you.

00:00:29.695 --> 00:00:31.262
Thanks.

00:00:31.262 --> 00:00:32.524
[GLASS CHIMING]

00:00:32.524 --> 00:00:35.005
Could I have
your attention, please?

00:00:40.314 --> 00:00:43.100
Before we begin the feast,

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.843
let us have a round of applause
for Professor Sprout,

00:00:46.843 --> 00:00:49.715
Madam Pomfrey,

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:50.890
whose Mandrake juice

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:52.414
has been so successfully
administered

00:00:52.414 --> 00:00:56.156
to all who had been Petrified.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:10.127
Also, in light
of the recent events,

00:01:10.127 --> 00:01:12.042
as a school treat,

00:01:12.042 --> 00:01:16.133
all exams have been canceled.

00:01:18.352 --> 00:01:20.180
[SILENTLY]
Oh, no.

00:01:37.284 --> 00:01:39.025
Sorry I'm late.

00:01:45.031 --> 00:01:47.469
The owl that delivered
my release papers

00:01:47.469 --> 00:01:49.862
got all lost and confused.

00:01:49.862 --> 00:01:52.386
Some ruddy bird called Errol.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.796
And I'd just like to say

00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:13.320
that if it hadn't been for you,
Harry...

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.322
and Ron...

00:02:15.322 --> 00:02:16.889
and Hermione, of course...

00:02:18.369 --> 00:02:20.893
I would...

00:02:20.893 --> 00:02:23.200
I'd still be you-know-where...

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.420
so I'd just like to say thanks.

00:02:35.908 --> 00:02:38.215
There's no Hogwarts
without you, Hagrid.

00:03:02.718 --> 00:03:05.547
[ALL CHEERING]

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.179
[♪♪♪]

